legend-title = How to read the board
legend-trays = Attacks and defenses: in each of the three slots choose an attack and a defense, physical or magical. A defense of the same type blocks the attack.
legend-stats = The "4/3" and "3/0" tiles: physical attack/defense and magical attack/defense. Damage is the attack minus the opponent's defense; further hits in a round count ×2 and ×4.
legend-health = The heart is health. Dropping to 0 ends the duel with a knockout.
legend-stamina = The lungs are stamina (W). A hit costs as much W as the attack; a spell costs the W on its green coin. Without W you cannot block.
legend-focus = K is focus: +4 K every round. A spell costs as much K as the blue coin next to its name.
legend-initiative = The ◆ next to a name is the initiative: that side casts first and strikes first every round.
legend-previous = The row between the trays shows the opponent's attacks and defenses from the previous round.
shortcuts = Keys: 1–3 attacks · 4–6 defenses · Q–T cards · Shift + card for details · Enter confirm · P replay · Space skip
